    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ps116">
        <head xml:id="gom-ps116-Hd1e98">Psalmus 116</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps116-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps116-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps116-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps116_1@1-1">Alleluia.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-ps116-Nd1e110" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e113">Brevis psalmus, omnium primus atomus, id est sine divisione: pro sui enim brevitate non recipit divisionem, sed omnes compendio suae locutionis superat, et est quasi punctus psalmorum, unde diversae species formantur. Mira variatio contra taedium salutaria dicere, modo paucis, modo late.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps116-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps116_1@2-5">Laudate Dominum, omnes gentes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e121"><name xml:id="gom-ps116-Nd1e122" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e125">Ne qui praetereantur de toto orbe.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps116-d1e128">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e130" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ps116_1@2-5"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e132"><name xml:id="gom-ps116-Nd1e133" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e136">Et <pb ed="#P" n="1039B"/> haec sunt atria illa domus Domini, et ille omnis populus, unde in praecedenti psalmo egit. Non soli Judaei (qui sibi illud arrogare conantur) dico laudate eum. Et collaudate.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps116-d1e142">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e144" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ps116_1@2-5"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e146"><name xml:id="gom-ps116-Nd1e147" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e150">ut sit in unum redacta omnium laudatio quod est catholicae Ecclesiae.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps116-Dd1e154">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps116-Hd1e156">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps116-d1e158">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e160" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps116_2@2-2">Confirmata.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e163"><name xml:id="gom-ps116-Nd1e164" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e167">Quia quod per prophetas promisit, adventu Christi complevit; et firmavit misericordiam, ut nunquam moveatur, quia qui dedit, custodit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps116-d1e170">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e172" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps116_2@11-13">Manet in aeternum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps116-Rd1e175"><name xml:id="gom-ps116-Nd1e176" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps116-Qd1e179">Sive in eis quae promisit piis, sive in eis quae minatur impiis.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
